  "body": "Every browser I've tried does not collapse whitespace inside input elements that act as text inputs. https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#the-input-element-as-a-text-entry-widget doesn't mention this behaviour, but https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#the-textarea-element-2 does.\n",
